  "question": {
    "text": "<p>As per the given figure, two blocks each of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> are connected to a spring of spring constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. If both are given velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math> in opposite directions, then maximum elongation of the spring is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0069_684186a7b42a.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 47px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
